results/phase1/RAW-GPT/

# Retired / pre-hook-fix run artifacts: contain real identity + escape traces.
# Quarantined out of results/ so the fleet containment gate scans only live cells.
_archive/

# Run artifacts stay local until the Phase 6 publication gate (LeakCheck over the full tree,
# no transcript naming a real person, a decision on the persona). Enforced here rather than
# remembered, because this is the path that leaked in Phases 1-3.
results/
